{
  "id": 3,
  "title": "The Instagram Miracle",
  "subtitle": "When Destiny Appeared on a Screen",
  "date": "December 13, 2024",
  "quote": "Sometimes, destiny doesn't knock on your door. It quietly appears on your Instagram feed.",
  "endQuote": "Some people enter your life with grand speeches. Others enter with a simple message. Grace entered my life with three simple words... 'Anna, syllabus please.' Looking back today, I smile because I never knew that one small message would become the beginning of the most beautiful conversation of my life.",
  "image": "/images/chapter03.jpg",
  "music": "/audio/chapter03.mp3",
  "atmosphere": "particles",
  "readingTime": 5,
  "content": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "After meeting Grace for the very first time, I believed that would be the end of our story." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "She was just another junior." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I was just another senior." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "We had exchanged no words." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "No introductions." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "No conversations." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Just one unforgettable moment that somehow refused to leave my mind." },
    { "type": "section-break" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Days passed." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Life slowly returned to normal." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Classes continued." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Assignments piled up." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Club activities kept me busy." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "But deep inside, there was something I couldn't explain." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Every now and then, I found myself thinking about the girl whose name I had heard only once..." },
    { "type": "emphasis", "text": "Esther." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I didn't know why." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I didn't know how." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "But somehow, she stayed in my thoughts." },
    { "type": "section-break" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Then, two days later..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Something unbelievable happened." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I was casually scrolling through Instagram." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Nothing special." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Just another ordinary night." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Post after post..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Reel after reel..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Until suddenly..." },
    { "type": "emphasis", "text": "There she was." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Her profile appeared in my suggestions." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "For a few seconds, I simply stared at the screen." },
    { "type": "dialogue", "text": "\"Is this really her?\"" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I checked the profile again." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Yes." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "It was her." },
    { "type": "emphasis", "text": "Grace Esther." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I smiled without even realizing it." },
    { "type": "section-break" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Normally..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I never send follow requests to people I don't know." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "That has always been my rule." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Even if I knew someone from college, I would usually wait for them to send me a request first." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "But this time..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Something inside me was different." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "My heart whispered..." },
    { "type": "dialogue", "text": "\"Send the request.\"" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "My mind immediately argued back." },
    { "type": "dialogue", "text": "\"Why should I?\"" },
    { "type": "dialogue", "text": "\"She probably doesn't even know who I am.\"" },
    { "type": "dialogue", "text": "\"She might ignore it.\"" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "For almost five minutes, I kept opening and closing her profile." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Follow." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Back." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Follow." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Back." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "It felt like the hardest button I had ever pressed." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Finally..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I took a deep breath." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Closed my eyes for a second." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "And tapped..." },
    { "type": "emphasis", "text": "Follow." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Request Sent." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "That was it." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Nothing more." },
    { "type": "section-break" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I locked my phone and tried to forget about it." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "But the truth was..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I couldn't." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Every few minutes, I found myself checking Instagram again." },
    { "type": "dialogue", "text": "\"Did she accept?\"" },
    { "type": "dialogue", "text": "\"Not yet...\"" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I laughed at myself." },
    { "type": "dialogue", "text": "\"Hari... why are you acting like this?\"" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I had no answer." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "That night, I slept with only one thought in my mind." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Would she accept my request?" },
    { "type": "section-break" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "The next morning..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "The first thing I did wasn't brushing my teeth." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "It wasn't checking my messages." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "It wasn't even attending class." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I opened Instagram." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "And there it was." },
    { "type": "emphasis", "text": "Grace Esther had accepted my follow request." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "For a moment..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I couldn't stop smiling." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "But then something even more surprising happened." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "She had sent me a follow request back." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I looked at the screen again to make sure I wasn't imagining it." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "No..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "It was real." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I accepted it immediately." },
    { "type": "section-break" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "It was such a small action." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Just a follow request." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "But somehow..." },
    { "type": "emphasis", "text": "It felt like destiny had quietly opened the first door between us." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Neither of us knew it then." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "But that tiny notification would eventually become one of the most important moments of my life." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Because sometimes..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "The most beautiful stories don't begin with grand confessions." },
    { "type": "emphasis", "text": "They begin with a simple notification." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "\"Grace Esther started following you.\"" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "At that moment..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I still had no idea..." },
    { "type": "emphasis", "text": "That this girl would slowly become the most beautiful chapter of my life." }
  ]
}
